# API contract

`contracts/openapi.yaml` is the composed public contract. Do not edit it by
hand for module endpoints: edit the matching fragment under
`contracts/modules/` and run `make contracts`.

- `contracts/base/openapi.yaml` — base document, security scheme and shared
  metadata.
- `contracts/modules/*.yaml` — one fragment per selected module.
- `contracts/compose.py` — deterministic merge; `--check` fails when the
  composed output is stale.
- `contracts/events.json` — streaming event union used by the agent run
  endpoint and the UI.

Generated clients (TypeScript, Swift, Kotlin, Python and Rust) are added in a
later phase. Until then the clients in the scaffold are hand-written to the
same shapes.
